# Performance

- Prefer Server Components and static content; minimize client JS.
- Use `next/image` with modern formats; avoid huge unoptimized assets in the hero.
- Lazy-load below-the-fold motion/heavy media; respect reduced motion.
- Keep fonts limited to Geist via `next/font` already in the root layout.
- Avoid layout shift: reserve space for media and async UI.
- Measure LCP/CLS on key templates before adding decorative effects.
